msgstr "Paramètres → Général"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1322
msgid "App ID"
msgstr "ID de l'application"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1323
msgid "App Secret"
msgstr "Clé secrète de l'application"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1331
#. translators: 1: "App Review > Requests" breadcrumb, 2: "oembed_read" permission name
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Go to %1$s and request the %2$s permission. Meta typically approves in 1-3 "
"business days. Your app stays in Development Mode until approved; embeds "
"will work for the admin who created the app even before approval."
msgstr ""
"Va dans %1$s et demande l'autorisation %2$s. Meta l'approuve généralement "
"en 1 à 3 jours ouvrés. Ton application reste en mode développement jusqu'à "
"l'approbation ; les intégrations fonctionnent pour l'administrateur qui a "
"créé l'application, même avant l'approbation."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1332
msgid "App Review → Requests"
msgstr "Examen de l'application → Demandes"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1338
#. translators: 1: topic label, plural, lowercase (e.g. "topics"). 2: reply label, plural, lowercase (e.g. "replies").
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Save the settings here. Instagram and Facebook URLs pasted into %1$s and "
"%2$s will now unfurl as rich embeds."
msgstr ""
"Enregistre les réglages ici. Les URL Instagram et Facebook collées dans les "
"%1$s et les %2$s s'afficheront désormais sous forme d'aperçus enrichis."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1342
msgid "Privacy note:"
msgstr "Remarque sur la confidentialité :"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1343
msgid ""
"Jetonomy only sends oEmbed requests to Meta when a user pastes an "
"Instagram/Facebook URL. No tracking, no user data: just the public post URL "
"and your app token. Leave these fields blank to skip Instagram/Facebook "
"embeds entirely; the URL will render as a plain clickable link."
msgstr ""
"Jetonomy n'envoie des requêtes oEmbed à Meta que lorsqu'un utilisateur "
"colle une URL Instagram/Facebook. Aucun suivi, aucune donnée utilisateur : "
"uniquement l'URL de la publication publique et le jeton de ton application. "
"Laisse ces champs vides pour désactiver complètement les aperçus "
"Instagram/Facebook ; l'URL s'affichera alors comme un simple lien cliquable."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1351
